iples and cutting-edge technology. \n                            Your vision, our expertise.\n                        </p>\n                        <div className=\"flex space-x-4\">\n                            <a href=\"#\" className=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 hover600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover110 hover group\">\n                                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path d=\"M24 4.557c-.883.392-1.832.656-2.828.775 1.017-.609 1.798-1.574 2.165-2.724-.951.564-2.005.974-3.127 1.195-.897-.957-2.178-1.555-3.594-1.555-3.179 0-5.515 2.966-4.797 6.045-4.091-.205-7.719-2.165-10.148-5.144-1.29 2.213-.669 5.108 1.523 6.574-.806-.026-1.566-.247-2.229-.616-.054 2.281 1.581 4.415 3.949 4.89-.693.188-1.452.232-2.224.084.626 1.956 2.444 3.379 4.6 3.419-2.07 1.623-4.678 2.348-7.29 2.04 2.179 1.397 4.768 2.212 7.548 2.212 9.142 0 14.307-7.721 13.995-14.646.962-.695 1.797-1.562 2.457-2.549z\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" className=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 hover600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover110 hover group\">\n                                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path d=\"M22.46 6c-.77.35-1.6.58-2.46.69.88-.53 1.56-1.37 1.88-2.38-.83.5-1.75.85-2.72 1.05C18.37 4.5 17.26 4 16 4c-2.35 0-4.27 1.92-4.27 4.29 0 .34.04.67.11.98C8.28 9.09 5.11 7.38 3 4.79c-.37.63-.58 1.37-.58 2.15 0 1.49.75 2.81 1.91 3.56-.71 0-1.37-.2-1.95-.5v.03c0 2.08 1.48 3.82 3.44 4.21a4.22 4.22 0 0 1-1.93.07 4.28 4.28 0 0 0 4 2.98 8.521 8.521 0 0 1-5.33 1.84c-.34 0-.68-.02-1.02-.06C3.44 20.29 5.7 21 8.12 21 16 21 20.33 14.46 20.33 8.79c0-.19 0-.37-.01-.56.84-.6 1.56-1.36 2.14-2.23z\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" className=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 hover600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover110 hover group\">\n                                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path d=\"M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z\"/>\n                                </svg>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" className=\"w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 hover600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 hover110 hover group\">\n                                <svg className=\"w-5 h-5 text-gray-400 group-hover\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                    <path d=\"M12.017 0C5.396 0 .029 5.367.029 11.987c0 5.079 3.158 9.417 7.618 11.174-.105-.949-.199-2.403.041-3.439.219-.937 1.406-5.957 1.406-5.957s-.359-.219-.359-1.219c0-1.142.662-1.995 1.488-1.995.703 0 1.042.527 1.042 1.159 0 .705-.449 1.763-.681 2.739-.194.825.412 1.499 1.221 1.499 1.466 0 2.522-1.89 2.522-4.133 0-1.714-1.194-2.993-3.368-2.993-2.395 0-3.893 1.759-3.893 3.713 0 .674.199 1.15.509 1.521.144.173.165.243.112.444-.039.148-.126.497-.163.635-.052.194-.21.237-.482.144-1.332-.539-1.966-1.966-1.966-3.486 0-2.653 2.104-5.83 6.29-5.83 3.427 0 5.673 2.478 5.673 5.1 0 3.5-1.955 6.103-4.837 6.103-.977 0-1.889-.522-2.202-1.119l-.608 2.33c-.22.857-.815