>Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"#\" className=\"text-gray-300 hover transition-colors duration-200 hover1 transform inline-block\">Terms of Service</a></li>\n                            <li><a href=\"#\" className=\"text-gray-300 hover transition-colors duration-200 hover1 transform inline-block\">Cookie Policy</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n    \n                \n                <div className=\"border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 mb-8\">\n                    <div className=\"max-w-md mx-auto text-center\">\n                        <h3 className=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-white\">Stay Updated</h3>\n                        <p className=\"text-gray-300 mb-4\">Get the latest news and updates delivered to your inbox.</p>\n                        <div className=\"flex space-x-3\">\n                            <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" className=\"flex-1 px-4 py-2 bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg text-white placeholder-gray-400 focus focus2 focus500 focus transition-all duration-200\" />\n                            <button className=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium hover700 hover700 transition-all duration-300 hover105 transform shadow-lg\">\n                                Subscribe\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n    \n                \n                <div className=\"border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 flex flex-col md items-center justify-between\">\n                    <p className=\"text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 md0\">\n                        © 2025 Your Company Name. All rights reserved.\n                    </p>\n                    <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-6 text-sm text-gray-400\">\n                        <span>Made with</span>\n                        <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-1\">\n                            <svg className=\"w-4 h-4 text-red-500 animate-pulse\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path d=\"M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>by Our Team</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    \n        \n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
